{"seq":2,"slug":"variables-and-types","title":"变量与数据类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/bash-fundamentals/variables-and-types","wordCount":988,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"变量与数据类型\">变量与数据类型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Shell 中的变量本质上都是字符串，这与大多数编程语言有根本区别。Bash 没有内置的整数、浮点数或布尔类型——所有数据都以文本形式存储，仅在特定上下文（如算术运算或 <code>declare -i</code>）中才被解释为其他类型。理解这一设计哲学是避免 Shell 脚本中各种微妙错误的关键。</p>\n<p>Shell 变量分为局部变量、环境变量和特殊变量三大类。局部变量仅在当前 Shell 进程中可见，环境变量通过 <code>export</code> 导出后可被子进程继承，特殊变量由 Shell 自动维护（如 <code>$?</code>、`</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Can&#x27;t use function &#x27;$&#x27; in math mode at position 4: `、`$̲@`）。\n\n```mermai…\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">`、`$@`）。\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[Shell 变量体系] --&gt; B[局部变量]\n    A --&gt; C[环境变量]\n    A --&gt; D[特殊变量]\n    B --&gt; B1[用户自定义 name=value]\n    B --&gt; B2[函数内 local var=value]\n    C --&gt; C1[export 导出]\n    C --&gt; C2[系统预设 PATH HOME]\n    D --&gt; D1[位置参数 $1 $2 $@]\n    D --&gt; D2[状态变量 $?</span></div><p> $!]\n    D --&gt; D3[脚本信息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span># LINENO]</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&#10;| 变量类别      | 作用域              | 声明方式             | 子进程继承 | 典型用途     |&#10;| ------------- | ------------------- | -------------------- | ---------- | ------------ |&#10;| 局部变量      | 当前 Shell          | `var=value`          | 否         | 脚本内部逻辑 |&#10;| 环境变量      | 当前 Shell + 子进程 | `export var=value`   | 是         | 跨进程配置   |&#10;| local 变量    | 函数内部            | `local var=value`    | 否         | 函数封装     |&#10;| readonly 变量 | 当前 Shell          | `readonly var=value` | 否         | 常量定义     |&#10;| 位置参数      | 当前脚本/函数       | 自动设置             | 否         | 命令行参数   |&#10;&#10;## 变量赋值与引用&#10;&#10;### 赋值与花括号引用&#10;&#10;变量赋值时等号两边不能有空格，这是 Shell 新手最常犯的错误之一。变量引用时使用 `$` 前缀，花括号 `${}` 可以消除歧义并启用高级操作。&#10;&#10;```bash&#10;name=&quot;Shell 脚本&quot;&#10;count=42&#10;path=/usr/local/bin&#10;&#10;echo $name&#10;echo ${name}&#10;echo &quot;${name}教程&quot;&#10;echo &quot;${name}_advanced&quot;&#10;&#10;first=&quot;Hello&quot;&#10;second=&quot;World&quot;&#10;combined=&quot;${first} ${second}&quot;&#10;echo &quot;$combined&quot;&#10;&#10;readonly PI=3.14159&#10;readonly APP_VERSION=&quot;2.1.0&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 变量类别      | 作用域              | 声明方式             | 子进程继承 | 典型用途     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| ------------- | ------------------- | -------------------- | ---------- | ------------ |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 局部变量      | 当前 Shell          | `var=value`          | 否         | 脚本内部逻辑 |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 环境变量      | 当前 Shell + 子进程 | `export var=value`   | 是         | 跨进程配置   |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| local 变量    | 函数内部            | `local var=value`    | 否         | 函数封装     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| readonly 变量 | 当前 Shell          | `readonly var=value` | 否         | 常量定义     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| 位置参数      | 当前脚本/函数       | 自动设置             | 否         | 命令行参数   |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## 变量赋值与引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>### 赋值与花括号引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>变量赋值时等号两边不能有空格，这是 Shell 新手最常犯的错误之一。变量引用时使用 `$` 前缀，花括号 `${}` 可以消除歧义并启用高级操作。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>```bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name=\"Shell 脚本\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count=42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>path=/usr/local/bin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo $name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo ${name}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo \"${name}教程\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo \"${name}_advanced\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>first=\"Hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>second=\"World\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>combined=\"${first} ${second}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo \"$combined\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>readonly PI=3.14159</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>readonly APP_VERSION=\"2.1.0\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"引号与词分割\">引号与词分割</h3><p>引号的使用直接影响变量扩展和词分割行为。双引号允许变量扩展但防止词分割和通配符扩展，单引号完全禁止所有扩展：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引号形式</th>\n<th>变量扩展</th>\n<th>命令替换</th>\n<th>词分割/通配符</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双引号 <code>&quot;...&quot;</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单引号 <code>&#39;...&#39;</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无引号</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"files=&quot;file1.txt file2.txt&quot;&#10;echo $files             # 词分割：file1.txt 和 file2.txt 作为两个词&#10;echo &quot;$files&quot;           # 保持原样：file1.txt file2.txt 一个字符串&#10;&#10;path=&quot;/my path/with spaces&quot;&#10;ls $path                # 错误：ls 尝试访问 /my 和 path/with 和 spaces&#10;ls &quot;$path&quot;              # 正确：ls 访问 &quot;/my path/with spaces&quot;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;当前用户: $USER&quot;  # 变量被扩展&#10;echo &#39;当前用户: $USER&#39;  # 原样输出 $USER&#10;&#10;echo &quot;日期是 $(date)&quot;   # 命令替换会执行&#10;echo &#39;日期是 $(date)&#39;   # 原样输出 $(date)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">files</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"file1.txt file2.txt\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $files             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 词分割：file1.txt 和 file2.txt 作为两个词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$files</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 保持原样：file1.txt file2.txt 一个字符串</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/my path/with spaces\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $path                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 错误：ls 尝试访问 /my 和 path/with 和 spaces</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 正确：ls 访问 \"/my path/with spaces\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"当前用户: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$USER</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 变量被扩展</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '当前用户: $USER'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 原样输出 $USER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"日期是 $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 命令替换会执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '日期是 $(date)'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 原样输出 $(date)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"参数扩展技巧\">参数扩展技巧</h2><p>Bash 提供了丰富的参数扩展语法，可以在变量引用时直接进行字符串操作，避免调用外部命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"filename=&quot;/home/user/documents/report.tar.gz&quot;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;${filename##*/}&quot;    # report.tar.gz（删除最长前缀匹配 */）&#10;echo &quot;${filename%.*}&quot;     # /home/user/documents/report.tar（删除最短后缀匹配 .*）&#10;echo &quot;${filename%%.*}&quot;    # /home/user/documents/report（删除最长后缀匹配 .*）&#10;echo &quot;${filename#*/}&quot;     # home/user/documents/report.tar.gz（删除最短前缀匹配 */）&#10;&#10;url=&quot;https://api.example.com/v1/users&quot;&#10;echo &quot;${url/v1/v2}&quot;       # 替换第一个匹配&#10;echo &quot;${url//\\//|}&quot;       # 替换所有 / 为 |&#10;&#10;text=&quot;Hello World&quot;&#10;echo &quot;${text,,}&quot;          # hello world（全部转小写）&#10;echo &quot;${text^^}&quot;          # HELLO WORLD（全部转大写）&#10;echo &quot;${text,}&quot;           # hello World（首字母转小写）&#10;echo &quot;${text^}&quot;           # Hello World（首字母转大写）&#10;&#10;echo &quot;${#text}&quot;           # 11（字符串长度）&#10;echo &quot;${text:6}&quot;          # World（从位置 6 开始截取）&#10;echo &quot;${text:0:5}&quot;        # Hello（从位置 0 截取 5 个字符）&#10;echo &quot;${text: -5}&quot;        # World（从末尾截取 5 个字符，注意冒号后的空格）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filename</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/home/user/documents/report.tar.gz\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filename</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">##*/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # report.tar.gz（删除最长前缀匹配 */）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filename</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # /home/user/documents/report.tar（删除最短后缀匹配 .*）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filename</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%%</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # /home/user/documents/report（删除最长后缀匹配 .*）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filename</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#*/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # home/user/documents/report.tar.gz（删除最短前缀匹配 */）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com/v1/users\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 替换第一个匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">|}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 替换所有 / 为 |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello World\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,,}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # hello world（全部转小写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^^}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # HELLO WORLD（全部转大写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # hello World（首字母转小写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # Hello World（首字母转大写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 11（字符串长度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">6</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # World（从位置 6 开始截取）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">5</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # Hello（从位置 0 截取 5 个字符）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8