"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shift</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"shift 后的参数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$@</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"与-的区别\"><code>$@</code> 与 <code>$*</code> 的区别</h3><p><code>$@</code> 和 <code>$*</code> 的区别在引号内才能体现。<code>&quot;$@&quot;</code> 将每个参数保持为独立的字符串，而 <code>&quot;$*&quot;</code> 将所有参数合并为一个字符串：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"show_difference() {&#10;    echo &quot;--- \\&quot;\\$@\\&quot; ---&quot;&#10;    for arg in &quot;$@&quot;; do&#10;        echo &quot;  [$arg]&quot;&#10;    done&#10;&#10;    echo &quot;--- \\&quot;\\$*\\&quot; ---&quot;&#10;    for arg in &quot;$*&quot;; do&#10;        echo &quot;  [$arg]&quot;&#10;    done&#10;}&#10;&#10;show_difference &quot;hello world&quot; &quot;foo&quot; &quot;bar baz&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">show_difference</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"--- </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"\\$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ---\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$@</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"  [</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$arg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"--- </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"\\$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ---\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"  [</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$arg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">show_difference</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello world\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"foo\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"bar baz\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><p>变量处理是 Shell 新手最容易踩坑的环节，下表汇总几类高频错误及其修正方式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误写法</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确写法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>name = value</code></td>\n<td>等号两侧有空格被当成命令</td>\n<td><code>name=value</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>echo $files</code></td>\n<td>未加引号导致词分割</td>\n<td><code>echo &quot;$files&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>${var}</code> 引用未定义变量</td>\n<td>在 <code>set -u</code> 下报错退出</td>\n<td><code>${var:-default}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>arr=$(...)</code> 当数组用</td>\n<td>实为字符串，索引失效</td>\n<td><code>mapfile -t arr &lt; &lt;(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>local x=$(cmd)</code> 丢失退出码</td>\n<td><code>local</code> 吞掉 <code>cmd</code> 的返回值</td>\n<td>先 <code>local x</code> 再 <code>x=$(cmd)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Shell 变量本质上都是字符串，仅在特定上下文中被解释为其他类型</li>\n<li>变量赋值等号两边不能有空格，引用时推荐使用双引号 <code>&quot;${var}&quot;</code> 避免词分割问题</li>\n<li>参数扩展提供了强大的字符串操作能力：截取、替换、大小写转换、默认值设置</li>\n<li>索引数组用 <code>()</code> 声明，关联数组需要 <code>declare -A</code> 显式声明（Bash 4.0+）</li>\n<li><code>&quot;$@&quot;</code> 保持参数独立性，<code>&quot;$*&quot;</code> 合并为单一字符串——脚本中应始终优先使用 <code>&quot;$@&quot;</code></li>\n<li>特殊变量（<code>$?</code>、<code>$$</code>、<code>$!</code>、<code>$LINENO</code> 等）由 Shell 自动维护，是脚本调试和错误处理的基础</li>\n<li>引号规则：双引号允许变量扩展但防止词分割，单引号完全禁止扩展</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变量与数据类型","id":"变量与数据类型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"引号与词分割","id":"引号与词分割"},{"level":2,"text":"参数扩展技巧","id":"参数扩展技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"默认值与条件赋值","id":"默认值与条件赋值"},{"level":2,"text":"数组与关联数组","id":"数组与关联数组"},{"level":3,"text":"关联数组","id":"关联数组"},{"level":2,"text":"特殊变量与位置参数","id":"特殊变量与位置参数"},{"level":3,"text":"`@` 与 `*` 的区别","id":"与-的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Shell 基础入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/bash-fundamentals/shell-basics"},"next":{"title":"流程控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/bash-fundamentals/control-flow"}}